There’s more to this town than sourdough.

WalletHub has dished up its annual list of America’s best cities for foodies, spotlighting destinations where diners can feast on highly rated fare without spending a small fortune.

One Bay Area destination landed at No. 3 — not bad for a place where the cost of living can take a serious bite out of your wallet.

